<html lang='zh-CN'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
    <meta name='x-apple-disable-message-reformatting' />
    <meta name='color-scheme' content='light only' />
    <meta name='supported-color-schemes' content='light only' />
    <title>邀请您加入{{appName}}</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        color-scheme: light only;
        supported-color-schemes: light only;
      }
      body,
      table,
      td,
      p,
      a {
        color-scheme: light only;
      }
      @media screen and (max-width: 620px) {
        .email-outer {
          padding: 16px 8px 24px !important;
        }
        .email-card {
          width: 100% !important;
        }
        .email-content {
          padding: 24px 20px 28px !important;
        }
        .email-title {
          font-size: 28px !important;
          line-height: 36px !important;
        }
        .email-hero {
          border-radius: 18px 18px 0 0 !important;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body
    style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f5f4ee;color:#141413;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;"
  >
    <div
      style='display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;color:transparent;'
    >您收到了一封来自 {{appName}} 的账户邀请</div>
    <table
      class='email-bg'
      role='presentation'
      width='100%'
      cellspacing='0'
      cellpadding='0'
      border='0'
      background='{{emailAssetBaseUrl}}/auth-paper.jpg'
      style="width:100%;background:#f5f4ee url('{{emailAssetBaseUrl}}/auth-paper.jpg') center top / cover no-repeat;"
    >
      <tr>
        <td class='email-outer' align='center' style='padding:34px 14px 38px;'>
          <table
            class='email-card'
            role='presentation'
            width='600'
            cellspacing='0'
            cellpadding='0'
            border='0'
            style='width:600px;max-width:100%;background:#fff9f0;border:1px solid #d7d1c4;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;'
          >
            <tr>
              <td style='padding:0;'>
                <img
                  class='email-hero'
                  src='{{emailAssetBaseUrl}}/auth-hero.jpg'
                  width='600'
                  alt=''
                  style='display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:20px 20px 0 0;'
                />
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class='email-content' align='center' style='padding:30px 42px 34px;'>
                <img
                  src='{{emailAssetBaseUrl}}/chenchat-wordmark.png'
                  width='136'
                  height='42'
                  alt='尘Chat'
                  style='display:block;width:136px;height:42px;border:0;'
                />
                <div style='height:20px;line-height:20px;'>&nbsp;</div>
                <span
                  style='display:inline-block;padding:7px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:#f1d8ce;color:#8f4328;font-size:11px;line-height:14px;letter-spacing:.12em;font-weight:700;'
                >账户邀请</span>
                <h1
                  class='email-title'
                  style="margin:18px 0 0;color:#141413;font-family:Georgia,'Noto Serif SC','Songti SC',serif;font-size:34px;line-height:42px;font-weight:600;"
                >邀请您加入{{appName}}</h1>
                <div
                  style='margin:14px auto 0;width:36px;height:3px;background:#da7756;border-radius:999px;'
                >&nbsp;</div>
                <p
                  style='margin:20px auto 0;max-width:450px;color:#675d53;font-size:16px;line-height:27px;'
                >您好。管理员邀请您创建
                  {{appName}}
                  账户，在一个工作空间中使用对话、工具、Skills 与 Artifacts。</p>
                <table
                  role='presentation'
                  cellspacing='0'
                  cellpadding='0'
                  border='0'
                  style='margin:28px auto 0;'
                >
                  <tr>
                    <td
                      align='center'
                      bgcolor='#da7756'
                      style='border:1px solid #bd6244;border-radius:10px;'
                    >
                      <a
                        href='{{{inviteLink}}}'
                        target='_blank'
                        style='display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;color:#141413;font-size:15px;line-height:18px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;'
                      >接受邀请</a>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
                <p
                  style='margin:22px auto 0;max-width:460px;color:#675d53;font-size:13px;line-height:21px;'
                >邀请链接将在 7 天后失效。若按钮无法打开，请复制以下地址：</p>
                <p
                  style='margin:8px auto 0;max-width:500px;color:#8f4328;font-size:12px;line-height:19px;word-break:break-all;'
                >{{{inviteLink}}}</p>
                <table
                  role='presentation'
                  width='100%'
                  cellspacing='0'
                  cellpadding='0'
                  border='0'
                  style='margin-top:26px;border-top:1px dashed #d7d1c4;'
                >
                  <tr>
                    <td
                      style='padding-top:20px;color:#556545;font-size:13px;line-height:21px;'
                    >若您不认识邀请方，可以忽略这封邮件。</td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
          <p style='margin:18px 0 0;color:#675d53;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;'>此邮件由
            {{appName}}
            自动发送，请勿直接回复。<br />&copy;
            {{year}}
            {{appName}}</p>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>